sequenceDiagram
    actor Luis
    participant SP as StaffPage
    participant SC as StaffController
    participant OS as OrderStore
    participant SS as StaffStore

    Luis->>SP: Next status, or Cancel + reason
    SP->>SC: changeStatus(number, version, to, reason)
    SC->>SS: findSession(sessionId)
    SS-->>SC: employee
    critical One transaction
        SC->>OS: getOrder(number)
        alt Same version Luis saw
            OS-->>SC: status, same version
            SC->>SC: canChange(from, to, reason)
            SC->>OS: saveStatus(number, to, reason, employee)
        else Changed by someone else
            OS-->>SC: status, newer version
        end
    end
    SC-->>SP: updated order, or 409 + current order
    SP-->>Luis: New status, or the conflict and why
    Note right of SS: One 409, nothing<br/>resent. If still valid,<br/>Luis chooses again<br/>on the new version.
